# Frontend de desarrollo: Nginx delante de Vite (recarga en caliente). Aplica el mismo
# idioma por dominio, canonical, hreflang y cabeceras de seguridad que producción;
# /api y /.well-known los reparte el gateway.
# $connection_upgrade lo define el nginx.conf del paquete de Alpine.

server {
    listen 8080;
    server_name _;
    absolute_redirect off;

    location = /healthz {
        access_log off;
        default_type text/plain;
        return 200 'ok';
    }

    location = /version.json {
        default_type application/json;
        add_header Cache-Control "no-store" always;
        return 200 '{"revision":"dev"}';
    }

    # robots.txt y sitemap.xml del dominio que se visita
    location = /robots.txt {
        add_header Cache-Control "public, max-age=3600" always;
        alias /etc/nginx/seo/robots-$site_lang.txt;
    }
    location = /sitemap.xml {
        add_header Cache-Control "public, max-age=3600" always;
        alias /etc/nginx/seo/sitemap-$site_lang.xml;
    }

    # Vite con HMR por WebSocket
    location / {
        include /etc/nginx/snippets/security-headers.conf;
        # /pt/… en un dominio que no aloja ese idioma → el dominio que sí
        if ($locale_redirect) { return 301 $locale_redirect; }
        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:5187;
        proxy_http_version 1.1;
        proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;
        proxy_set_header Connection $connection_upgrade;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header Accept-Encoding "";
        proxy_read_timeout 86400s;

        sub_filter '<html lang="es">' '<html lang="$page_lang">';
        sub_filter '<title>TuEventoFun</title>' '<title>$seo_title</title>';
        sub_filter '<meta name="description" content="TuEventoFun"/>' '<meta name="description" content="$seo_description"/>';
        sub_filter '<meta name="tuevento-seo"/>' '$seo_links';
        sub_filter_types text/html;
        sub_filter_once on;
    }
}
